@node Usage
@chapter Usage
@cindex usage
@cindex command-line options

You can invoke @value{CMD} from your terminal by passing an input file and optional flags.

@example
mytool --verbose input.txt
@end example

@section Common Flags

@table @code
@item --help
@cindex @option{--help}
Displays usage information and exits.

@item --version
@cindex @option{--version}
Prints version @value{VERSION} and exits.
@end table
